<title>CHINA: China's Sanonda first half net up 44 pct.</title>
<headline>China's Sanonda first half net up 44 pct.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-08-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30</p>
<p>(in millions of yuan unless stated, against 1996 figures)</p>
<p> Turnover		  470.66   vs  463.24</p>
<p> Net Profits		61.20   vs 42.56</p>
<p> Earnings per share	0.206 yuan</p>
<p> Net assets per share    3.21  yuan</p>
<p>Company name: Hubei Sanonda Co Ltd</p>
<p>Note: The unaudited results were published in a report in the Shenzhen-based Securities Times on Tuesday.</p>
<p>The report did not specify whether the results were compiled under international or Chinese accounting standards. Comparative per share figures were not immediately available.</p>
<p>($1.0 = 8.3 yuan)</p>
</text>
